  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Finely chop garlic. Thinly slice zucchini into half-moons. <br>• Chop broccoli (including stalk!) into small florets.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e20a947594446a7cdcbbd0/step-f8a06200.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Heat a large frying pan with a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook zucchini and broccoli tossing, until tender, 4-6 minutes. Stir in garlic until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.<br>• Season with salt and pepper. Transfer veggies to a second medium bowl. Cover to keep warm.<br>• Wipe out frying pan and return to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. When oil is hot, cook plant-based crumbed chicken until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side. <br>• Remove pan from heat, add BBQ sauce and the honey. Sprinkle over Aussie spice blend. Turn plant-based crumbed chicken to coat.<br><br>TIP: Add a dash of water to pan with the veggies to help speed up the cooking process.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e20a947594446a7cdcbbd0/step-9ba3e210.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a medium saucepan, combine the water, milk and salt and bring to the boil over high heat.<br>• Reduce heat to medium and slowly whisk in polenta, then cook, stirring, until smooth and thickened, 1-2 minutes.<br>• Remove from the heat, add the butter and a good pinch of pepper and stir until melted.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e20a947594446a7cdcbbd0/step-736d3520.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide sticky honey BBQ plant-based crumbed chicken, creamy polenta and veggies between plates.<br>• Spoon any remaining sauce from the pan over the plant-based crumbed chicken and polenta to serve. Enjoy!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e20a947594446a7cdcbbd0/step-be0cc630.jpg"
    }
  ]
